# Release bundle built by hand: it is autoclicker.exe (53 MB, already ignored
# on the line above) zipped up with the sources beside it. Git stores it as one
# opaque blob that changes wholesale on every build, and GitHub warns past 50 MB
# and refuses past 100. A built archive belongs on the Releases page, not in
# the history.
autoclicker.zip

